{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012303001:1":{"text":"그 끔찍한 생물이 또 나타나려는 건가...","source_cn":"那种可怕的生物是不是又要出现了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA062B191C802976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1012303001":{"text":"그 끔찍한 생물이 또 나타나려는 건가...","source_cn":"那种可怕的生物是不是又要出现了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA062B191C802976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012303002:1":{"text":"이런... 괜히 지레 겁먹었네요.","source_cn":"什么……那我白做心理准备了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0320EE80AB41A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012303003:1":{"text":"이게 우리의 마지막 시험이었으면 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"你向弥萨忒祈祷吧，但愿这是我们最后的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DE15FA2B066353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012303004:1":{"text":"이걸 시험이라고 생각해? 뭘 시험하는 걸까... 설마 용기?","source_cn":"你认为这是考验？考验什么啊……该不是考验胆量？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x550725C130213335","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012303005:1":{"text":"우리가 달빛 그림자로 들어갈 자격이 있는지에 대한 실험?","source_cn":"考验我们是否有进入月影乡的资格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A41371616E241B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012303006:1":{"text":"어디로 들어가지? 앞엔 길이 없는데.","source_cn":"从哪进？前面根本没路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C41005102CEE1A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012303007:1":{"text":"겉으로 보기엔 길이 없긴 해.","source_cn":"只是用肉眼看的话，前方确实没有路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF96A5A5B03C1DCC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012303008:1":{"text":"로잔, 브라이언, 무슨 소리 들었어?","source_cn":"洛桑，布莱恩，你们能否听出什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC414112FD18F5E53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012303009:2":{"text":"지금은 안 들려요.","source_cn":"暂时不行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x149C5ABA52F2023D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012303010:1":{"text":"만약 이 모든 게 시험이라면, 처음엔 내 궁술을 시험한 거고, 두 번째는 에이론의 검술을 시험한 거야.","source_cn":"如果这一切真的是考验，第一次，是考验我的箭术，第二次，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA448076343DE2CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012303011:1":{"text":"이번엔 방랑자로서 너의 감지력을 시험하는 걸지도 몰라, 브라이언.","source_cn":"这一次，或许是考验你作为风语者的感知力，布莱恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2577514C934ED0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012303012:2":{"text":"이곳의 방랑자는 저뿐만이 아닙니다. 로잔 님이 저보다 더 정찰에 능숙하시죠.","source_cn":"这里不止我一个风语者，洛桑比我更擅长探查。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFC672F33B27FDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012303013:1":{"text":"이럴 때 오히려 겸손해지네...","source_cn":"这时候你反倒谦虚起来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A7FF2F570EF40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1012303013":{"text":"이럴 때 오히려 겸손해지네...","source_cn":"这时候你反倒谦虚起来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A7FF2F570EF40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012303014:0":{"text":"그렇게 말씀하시니, 열심히 해볼게요!","source_cn":"有你这么说，我一定会努力的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x96FA183A24A90891","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇게 말씀하시니, 열심히 해볼게요!","female":"그렇게 말씀하시니, 열심히 해볼게요!","variant_male_record_index":"109872","variant_female_record_index":"109873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012303017:0":{"text":"이제 영혼을 부르는 의식을 할게요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 금빛이삭 마을에서 본 적 있죠?","source_cn":"接下来我会使用聚灵仪式，<style=stress><...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x623210FE004D8C58","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이제 영혼을 부르는 의식을 할게요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 금빛이삭 마을에서 본 적 있죠?","female":"이제 영혼을 부르는 의식을 할게요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 금빛이삭 마을에서 본 적 있죠?","variant_male_record_index":"109876","variant_female_record_index":"109877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012303018:1":{"text":"이번에도 의식에 필요한 <style=\"highlight\">월계수 나뭇가지</style>를 모아주세요. 전 이곳에 남아 의식을 준비할게요.","source_cn":"这次也要麻烦你们去收集仪式所需的<style=high...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x51BDA181C205ED26","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이번에도 의식에 필요한 <style=\"highlight\">월계수 나뭇가지</style>를 모아주세요. 전 이곳에 남아 의식을 준비할게요.","female":"이번에도 의식에 필요한 <style=\"highlight\">월계수 나뭇가지</style>를 모아주세요. 전 이곳에 남아 의식을 준비할게요.","variant_male_record_index":"109878","variant_female_record_index":"109879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012303019:1":{"text":"...전에 우리가 했던 것처럼요!","source_cn":"——就和之前咱们曾经做过的一样！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25C1A112800ABA64","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...전에 우리가 했던 것처럼요!","female":"...전에 우리가 했던 것처럼요!","variant_male_record_index":"109880","variant_female_record_index":"109881","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"